<section xml:id="sec_voltage-diagrams2" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
	<title>Voltage Diagrams</title>

	<activity xml:id="x_voltage-sketch">
			<title>Voltage Sketch</title>
			<p>
				
			</p>
			<p>Pretend you are a little positive charge starting at the bottom left corner of the circuit from the end of the video. Sketch the voltage you experience as a function of time as you travel once around the circuit. Explain your reasoning behind your sketch.</p>
		</activity>
		
